{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>InsPanorama 是一款讓全景照片在 Instagram 上完整分享的工具，適合喜歡拍攝全景照片及短片並發佈到社交平台的用戶。它可避免照片被裁切，亦能把全景照片轉成影片，方便分享到 TikTok；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-114.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>全景照片輕鬆分享</h2>\n<p>InsPanorama 提供 39 款濾鏡，讓全景照片不再受裁切限制，可直接分享至 Instagram。用戶亦可把全景照片轉換成影片，調整播放時間、加入音樂與文字，並套用多種模板及背景，令作品更適合發佈到 TikTok。整個過程以簡單操作完成，而且不會加入廣告。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-11.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-12.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-13.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-14.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：InsPanorama</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/inspanorama/id1273977606?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.661247+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:57:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:09.265653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.696219+00:00","content_hash":"f4e907857e99df5588e6b325d5a33e2fa45c6d47b28735b1be70f3b54b26bf24","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.661247+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}